#: rc.cpp:43 rc.cpp:135 rc.cpp:232
msgid "Medium Quality (DSL, Cable, fast Internet)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:44 rc.cpp:136 rc.cpp:233
msgid "Low Quality (Modem, ISDN, slow Internet)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:45 rc.cpp:137
msgid ""
"Use this to specify the performance of your connection. Note that you should "
"select the speed of the weakest link - even if you have a high speed "
"connection, it will not help you if the remote computer uses a slow modem. "
"Choosing too high a quality on a slow link will cause slower response times. "
"Choosing a lower quality will increase latencies in high speed connections "
"and results in lower image quality, especially in 'Low Quality' mode."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:46 rc.cpp:138 rc.cpp:235
msgid "&Enable encryption (secure, but slow and not always possible)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:47 rc.cpp:139 rc.cpp:236
msgid ""
"Enable this option to encrypt the connection. Only newer servers support "
"this option. Encrypting prevents others from eavesdropping, but can slow "
"down the connection considerably."
msgstr ""

